He studies how our emotions shape our decisions and our behavior. Peter Salove, welcome to Hidden Brain. Thank you so much, Shankar. It's a real honor to be with you. I listen to your show regularly and I've enjoyed seeing you live as well. And so it's a privilege to be a guest. Peter, in addition to being a psychology professor at Yale,
