you've held several administrative posts at the university, including Provost and Dean. While you were dean, a prominent individual visited the campus. Can you paint me a picture of the moment you got to shake hands with the president? Yes, we had invited President Clinton to visit campus. And if memory serves, he was going to give a talk on campus at the time. And they lined all of us up, all the deans in the boardroom, actually, of the university. when you were around the perimeter
