which is our ability-based emotion test, measures. We organize them slightly differently than Ruler, but you can see the overlap very clearly. I understand that when people ask you how they might, improve their own emotional intelligence, you have a couple of practical suggestions for them, and one sounds like advice from an English teacher, which is to read good literature. Why would reading help us increase our emotional intelligence, Peter? Well, it is an interesting question, because one of the things we know is that your emotional
也就是我们的基于能力的测评。我们对它们的组织方式与 Ruler 略有不同，但你可以非常清晰地看到它们之间的重叠。我了解到，当人们问你如何能够提高他们自己的情商时，你对他们有一些切实可行的建议，其中一个听起来像是英语老师给出的建议，那就是阅读优秀的文学作品。为什么阅读能帮助我们提高情商呢，彼得？嗯，这是一个有趣的问题，因为我们所了解的事情之一是，你的情感

