You know, in method acting, one of the techniques you might use to create an emotion is actually to enact the behaviors associated with that emotion, and then that emotion might follow. Act as if crying and crying might follow. Well, having those kind of experiences either as an observer or actually being on stage yourself might help you develop a more sophisticated understanding of how our emotions work and how they're connected to behavior and cognition. You know, I'm thinking about the times when we go to a gym and we start working with, you know, different equipment.
你知道，在方法演技中，你用来产生情感的技术之一，实际上就是去表演与该情感相关的行为，接着那种情感可能会随之而来。表现得像是在哭泣，哭泣可能就会随之发生。嗯，无论作为旁观者还是亲自登上舞台，拥有这些经历都可以帮助你对我们的情感如何运作以及它们如何与行为和认知相连，产生更复杂的理解。你知道，我在想我们去健身房并开始使用各种器械的时候。

