00:41:38.000 --> 00:42:10.000
And all of a sudden you realize that you had muscles that you didn't know that you had because your body starts to ache and pain in different places. And in some ways, what you're talking about emotions is actually not that different, that in some ways, the more we exercise our emotional repertoire, the more we discover that we have emotional recesses almost, that we haven't really explored, that are worth exploring and strengthening. I think that's exactly right, Chunker. And the more you do it, the better you develop these skills so that empathizing becomes
