natural, so that recognizing emotions in someone who is saying something different than their feeling becomes more second nature. so that you develop over time muscles that allow you to take advantage of the data that is inherent in our emotional system. And it becomes, I don't want to sound too woo-woo here, but it becomes kind of like a sixth sense. Yes, we see and we hear and we taste and we smell and we touch, but we also feel our emotions and maybe there's some data there that is being conveyed to us that we should pay attention to.
自然而然，从而让识别那些言不由衷之人的真实情感变得更像是第二天性。这样，随着时间的推移，你就会锻炼出肌肉，使你能够充分利用我们情感系统中固有的数据。它变得——我不想在这里听起来太玄乎——但它有点像第六感。是的，我们能看到、听到、尝到、闻到、摸到，但我们也能感受到我们的情感，也许其中传递着一些我们应该予以关注的数据。

